(6907223, 1041156, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely!!</td>', 'Lovely!!', '2012-11-16 00:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907224, 1041418, 15711, '<td valign="top">I have an Intellivision!!!</td>', 'I have an Intellivision!!!', '2012-11-16 00:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907231, 1041397, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely!!</td>', 'This is lovely!!', '2012-11-16 00:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907232, 1041416, 86447, '<td valign="top">Why does her belly look like that?    It seems odd.<br/> <br/>The rest is... excellent.   But... not exactly perfect for the challenge.  7</td>', 'Why does her belly look like that?    It seems odd. The rest is... excellent.   But... not exactly perfect for the challenge.  7', '2012-11-16 00:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907243, 1041385, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I like the hazelnuts in the foreground, but find the tones/lighting a bit flat</td>', 'Great concept. I like the hazelnuts in the foreground, but find the tones/lighting a bit flat', '2012-11-16 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907245, 1041143, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awwwww</td>', 'Awwwww', '2012-11-16 00:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907247, 1041401, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary on so many levels. Not only is it technically breathtaking (I particularly love the luminous edging of the arms), but the concept as well is just superb. My ONLY nit (and it is minuscule), is that the hair in the center does not seem to flow from her head, but has been added after. It is possible that it was not and it is just the angle, but it looks odd. Also, the way the leaves fade off on the right seem a bit odd somehow, not matching the pp''g in the rest of the image. As I said, such incredibly tiny issues. For me, the clear blue.</td>', 'This is extraordinary on so many levels. Not only is it technically breathtaking (I particularly love the luminous edging of the arms), but the concept as well is just superb. My ONLY nit (and it is minuscule), is that the hair in the center does not seem to flow from her head, but has been added after. It is possible that it was not and it is just the angle, but it looks odd. Also, the way the leaves fade off on the right seem a bit odd somehow, not matching the pp''g in the rest of the image. As I said, such incredibly tiny issues. For me, the clear blue.', '2012-11-16 00:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907248, 1041446, 96751, '<td valign="top">The Big Bang caught on film, B!</td>', 'The Big Bang caught on film, B!', '2012-11-16 00:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907249, 1041364, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha!</td>', 'Hahahahaha!', '2012-11-16 00:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907250, 1041441, 96751, '<td valign="top">Mezmerising, tactile. Love this.</td>', 'Mezmerising, tactile. Love this.', '2012-11-16 00:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
