(6907253, 1041410, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome light. Just wish there was a TINY bit more detail in the dark area of the nest and eg.</td>', 'Awesome light. Just wish there was a TINY bit more detail in the dark area of the nest and eg.', '2012-11-16 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
