(6907284, 1041399, 96751, '<td valign="top">I totally want to adore this, and almost do, but I''m not getting the totally blank face. I understand he''s "under construction", but would have liked to see at least some portion of the features. I''m going to guess this is Joshua (from the tats). LOVE the hovering eggs :-)</td>', 'I totally want to adore this, and almost do, but I''m not getting the totally blank face. I understand he''s "under construction", but would have liked to see at least some portion of the features. I''m going to guess this is Joshua (from the tats). LOVE the hovering eggs :-)', '2012-11-16 00:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907285, 1041323, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept, nice elements. Not thrilled with the oversharpening.</td>', 'Excellent concept, nice elements. Not thrilled with the oversharpening.', '2012-11-16 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907313, 1041438, 64446, '<td valign="top">Of course, the sky! Simple and effective. The saturation is a bit too much though, that even the clouds and whites are somewhat blueish...</td>', 'Of course, the sky! Simple and effective. The saturation is a bit too much though, that even the clouds and whites are somewhat blueish...', '2012-11-16 01:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
