(6907447, 1041416, 49109, '<td valign="top">Might work better with a closer, vertical crop. Her belly looks like it was distorted in PS. Edges of the beam on the ground seem a bit too hard.</td>', 'Might work better with a closer, vertical crop. Her belly looks like it was distorted in PS. Edges of the beam on the ground seem a bit too hard.', '2012-11-16 06:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
