(6907511, 1041419, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Many don''t think about the work that goes into the foundation, and this shows it nicely.</td>', 'I like this. Many don''t think about the work that goes into the foundation, and this shows it nicely.', '2012-11-16 09:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
