(6910197, 1041348, 93565, '<td valign="top">Looks like you missed your focus a bit here. I personally prefer more strongly contrasting BW images, but I find the missed focus far more troublesome.</td>', 'Looks like you missed your focus a bit here. I personally prefer more strongly contrasting BW images, but I find the missed focus far more troublesome.', '2012-11-21 00:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910202, 1041397, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the scale doesn''t seem right here at all. The island with the pillar looks as though it''s the same distance as the woman, yet it seems as though there would have to be some separation.</td>', 'Interesting, but the scale doesn''t seem right here at all. The island with the pillar looks as though it''s the same distance as the woman, yet it seems as though there would have to be some separation.', '2012-11-21 00:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910210, 1041323, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot- I''m assuming you dodged the area behind the figures on the left pillar in order to improve separation, but it is a bit more drastic and looks synthetic. You might have considered cloning some grass or something into that area instead.</td>', 'Interesting shot- I''m assuming you dodged the area behind the figures on the left pillar in order to improve separation, but it is a bit more drastic and looks synthetic. You might have considered cloning some grass or something into that area instead.', '2012-11-21 00:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910211, 1041429, 93565, '<td valign="top">Simple. Interesting. Nicely done.</td>', 'Simple. Interesting. Nicely done.', '2012-11-21 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910238, 1041419, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool editing- looks like another Robert experiment.<br/> <br/>Sorta like cellshading.<br/>Really like the composition though, that''s where this one shines. The concrete pump arching through the sky, the way the foundation is obvious yet blends into the scene at once... very nice. And it has no eggs, to boot! Hooray!</td>', 'Cool editing- looks like another Robert experiment. Sorta like cellshading.Really like the composition though, that''s where this one shines. The concrete pump arching through the sky, the way the foundation is obvious yet blends into the scene at once... very nice. And it has no eggs, to boot! Hooray!', '2012-11-21 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910347, 1041401, 28742, '<td valign="top">There''s the blue!</td>', 'There''s the blue!', '2012-11-21 03:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910487, 1041397, 136989, '<td valign="top">Really like the elements of the photo and the colors.  Not fond of the off center for the island that leaves the extra blue on left but the eye is drawn back to the isle so it seems to work.</td>', 'Really like the elements of the photo and the colors.  Not fond of the off center for the island that leaves the extra blue on left but the eye is drawn back to the isle so it seems to work.', '2012-11-21 08:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
