(6910625, 1041232, 144365, '<td valign="top">This looks like something I''ve done many times before. Hollowed out fruit and fired it with a snooted flash to illuminate it from the inside. Good job and it''s in my top five currently.</td>', 'This looks like something I''ve done many times before. Hollowed out fruit and fired it with a snooted flash to illuminate it from the inside. Good job and it''s in my top five currently.', '2012-11-21 11:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
