(6912212, 1041436, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ribbon hog!  Wow this is great.  It looks like you do pretty good with expert editing.  Congrats on another ribbon :D</td>', 'Ribbon hog!  Wow this is great.  It looks like you do pretty good with expert editing.  Congrats on another ribbon :D', '2012-11-23 22:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912213, 1041436, 30982, '<td valign="top">Two on the front page at one time - you''re a regular Ribbon Hog!  Congrats!</td>', 'Two on the front page at one time - you''re a regular Ribbon Hog!  Congrats!', '2012-11-23 22:09:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912217, 1041441, 97225, '<td valign="top">Too bad this didn''t finish higher. It really deserved to, but with all those 5s and 6s I feel I mightn''t have been the only one to miss the evolutionaries on first view.</td>', 'Too bad this didn''t finish higher. It really deserved to, but with all those 5s and 6s I feel I mightn''t have been the only one to miss the evolutionaries on first view.', '2012-11-23 22:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912316, 1041378, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by antje1777:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this image, but I must say I just don''t get the little woman in the water drop. I think it would have been a stronger image without her. 8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I couldn''t disagree more. You''ve made great choices in content here.<br/> <br/>Great execution too.</td>', 'Originally posted by antje1777: I like this image, but I must say I just don''t get the little woman in the water drop. I think it would have been a stronger image without her. 8   I couldn''t disagree more. You''ve made great choices in content here. Great execution too.', '2012-11-24 03:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
