(6912495, 1041401, 92577, '<td valign="top">You''re in a class of your own. (You''ll have to think about doing some tutorials for us and then later you can bundle them together and make some money by publishing them.)</td>', 'You''re in a class of your own. (You''ll have to think about doing some tutorials for us and then later you can bundle them together and make some money by publishing them.)', '2012-11-24 14:22:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912538, 1041383, 144271, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much everyone for the wonderful comments.  I never expected this to score this high since it was an expert challenge.  I am thrilled.</td>', 'Thanks so much everyone for the wonderful comments.  I never expected this to score this high since it was an expert challenge.  I am thrilled.', '2012-11-24 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912630, 1041429, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m going to have to look into this detail extractor... Congrats on the tt</td>', 'I''m going to have to look into this detail extractor... Congrats on the tt', '2012-11-24 18:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912803, 1041401, 103142, '<td valign="top">I always seem to be late to the commenting race. :)<br/> <br/>Magnificent idea -- and it''s amazing that you can make it a reality. <br/> <br/>It always makes me a little sick when I look at the larger versions, however. I''m always disappointed when I have to shrink to shrink down my own work, but when I see what it does to yours, it almost makes me want to cry! Your details are magnificent. Thanks again for your descriptions.  :)<br/> <br/>Huge congrats on the blue!</td>', 'I always seem to be late to the commenting race. :) Magnificent idea -- and it''s amazing that you can make it a reality.  It always makes me a little sick when I look at the larger versions, however. I''m always disappointed when I have to shrink to shrink down my own work, but when I see what it does to yours, it almost makes me want to cry! Your details are magnificent. Thanks again for your descriptions.  :) Huge congrats on the blue!', '2012-11-24 22:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912805, 1041378, 103142, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! Beautifully done. Congrats on the red!</td>', 'What a great idea! Beautifully done. Congrats on the red!', '2012-11-24 22:09:46.000000', NULL, 0),
