(6912957, 1041401, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it! I can''t imagine why anyone would hate it, but there are some low scores. Makes no sense to me. The concept, the execution, the light, are all exquisite. I am in awe of your creativity.</td>', 'Love it! I can''t imagine why anyone would hate it, but there are some low scores. Makes no sense to me. The concept, the execution, the light, are all exquisite. I am in awe of your creativity.', '2012-11-25 00:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
