(6913241, 1041378, 80831, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot.  Congrats on the red Samantha!</td>', 'Spectacular shot.  Congrats on the red Samantha!', '2012-11-25 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6913271, 1041401, 119419, '<td valign="top">Well done and congratulations Christophe &amp; Mrs Christophe. From your notes I suspect there may be a subliminal inspiration emerging that, perhaps, as an artist and scientist, you are struggling with (successfully), something that we all hopefully share at one level or another. I immediately thought of <a href="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/God2-Sistine_Chapel.png/1024px-God2-Sistine_Chapel.png" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> as a source, with all due modesty to Mrs C, something that even Einstein himself identified as a crucial part of his science. Not religion, but the spirituality of the mind. Given that, I wont be urging you for top job in the Vatican ;)</td>', 'Well done and congratulations Christophe & Mrs Christophe. From your notes I suspect there may be a subliminal inspiration emerging that, perhaps, as an artist and scientist, you are struggling with (successfully), something that we all hopefully share at one level or another. I immediately thought of this as a source, with all due modesty to Mrs C, something that even Einstein himself identified as a crucial part of his science. Not religion, but the spirituality of the mind. Given that, I wont be urging you for top job in the Vatican ;)', '2012-11-25 22:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
